{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>Come, let me advise you.</b> The counsel of sending the women, as explained in the verse: הֵן הֵנָּה הָיוּ לִבְנֵי יִשְׂרָאֵל בִּדְבַר בִּלְעָם (Numbers 31:16)." "<b>What this people will do to your people in the end of days.</b> For the harm that this people will do to your people will not occur in your days, and you have nothing to fear, but it will be only in the end of days, as it says: וּמָחַץ פַּאֲתֵי מוֹאָב (Numbers 24:17), and as it says: אֱדוֹם וּמוֹאָב מִשְׁלוֹחַ יָדָם (Isaiah 11:14)."], :book :numbers, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:41:04.083803843Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}